    "source_file": "BenchmarkSpecDefinitions.xlsx::Workload_Definitions",
    "value": "#1: Best Copy bandwidth, GB/s (copy_bandwidth_gb_s); #2: Best Scale bandwidth, GB/s (scale_bandwidth_gb_s); #3: Best Add bandwidth, GB/s (add_bandwidth_gb_s); #4: Best Triad bandwidth, GB/s (triad_bandwidth_gb_s)"
  },
  {
    "field_name": "Command Tools Executed",
    "source_file": "BenchmarkSpecDefinitions.xlsx::Workload_Definitions",
    "value": "Compile stream.c with gcc -O3 -fopenmp; run build/stream with OMP_NUM_THREADS; parse STREAM stdout. Does not use numactl"
  },
  {
    "field_name": "Command Execution Details and Purpose",
    "source_file": "BenchmarkSpecDefinitions.xlsx::Workload_Definitions",
    "value": "Compile official STREAM src/stream.c with gcc -O3 -fopenmp into build/stream (copied to bin/stream), run it with OMP_NUM_THREADS, parse Copy/Scale/Add/Triad Best Rate MB/s, convert to GB/s, and compute triad/400 efficiency, to measure CPU STREAM bandwidth. The collector does not launch with numactl. Overlay build.sh is unused"
  },
  {
    "field_name": "Command Methodology",
    "source_file": "BenchmarkSpecDefinitions.xlsx::Workload_Definitions",
    "value": "Compile src/stream.c with gcc -O3 -fopenmp, run build/stream under OMP_NUM_THREADS, parse Copy, Scale, Add, and Triad Best Rate MB/s, convert to GB/s, and compute triad/400 efficiency. numactl is not used"
  },
  {
    "field_name": "Execution Description With Parameters",
    "source_file": "BenchmarkSpecDefinitions.xlsx::Workload_Definitions",
    "value": "Compiles official STREAM src/stream.c with gcc -O3 -fopenmp into build/stream (copied to bin/stream) and runs Copy/Scale/Add/Triad. array_size: STREAM_ARRAY_SIZE. num_iterations: STREAM NTIMES. num_threads: OMP_NUM_THREADS. The collector does not launch with numactl. dtype is FP64 from the official source. thread_affinity, page_size, and kernel_types yaml fields are not applied as CLI knobs. The overlay scripts/build.sh is not used by the collector"
  },
