    "field_name": "Profile Parameter Values",
    "source_file": "BenchmarkSpecDefinitions.xlsx::Parameters_SmokeBaselineExtend",
    "value": "{\"numa_node\": {\"smoke\": \"0\", \"baseline\": \"0\", \"extended\": \"0\", \"notes\": \"\"}, \"num_threads\": {\"smoke\": \"4\", \"baseline\": \"16\", \"extended\": \"20\", \"notes\": \"\"}, \"thread_affinity\": {\"smoke\": \"core\", \"baseline\": \"core\", \"extended\": \"core\", \"notes\": \"\"}, \"page_size\": {\"smoke\": \"4KB\", \"baseline\": \"4KB\", \"extended\": \"4KB\", \"notes\": \"\"}, \"dtype\": {\"smoke\": \"FP64\", \"baseline\": \"FP64\", \"extended\": \"FP64\", \"notes\": \"\"}, \"array_size\": {\"smoke\": \"10000000\", \"baseline\": \"20000000\", \"extended\": \"40000000\", \"notes\": \"\"}, \"kernel_types\": {\"smoke\": \"copy,scale,add,triad\", \"baseline\": \"copy,scale,add,triad\", \"extended\": \"copy,scale,add,triad\", \"notes\": \"Sweep/list value. Command column documents it; omit this flag so yaml expands cases.\"}, \"num_iterations\": {\"smoke\": \"2\", \"baseline\": \"23280\", \"extended\": \"22600\", \"notes\": \"H100 2026-08-16 array_size=20M NTIMES=5000 -> 192s (3:12), 2 STREAM invocations ~86 GB/s. Extended 14300 extrapolated ~9:10 from 192s; use 15600 for ~10:00. Do not copy AMD 11000. Retimed 2026-08-17 toward 3-4 min baseline; extended scaled by the same factor. 2026-08-18 retune: baseline>=3min / extended>=10min or extended~15min; NVIDIA copied from AMD. | 2026-09-10: retimed from ledger (extended observed 22:33 @ num_iterations=37560) toward Gary's ~15 min target. Linear extrapolation, not yet re-measured. | 2026-09-28 GARY_LEDGER (aggregated_runtime_ledgers_101_201_301_401_20260928_9am; targets baseline 3-5 min, extended 8-15 min): 23280/25000 -> 23280/36000. extended 25000 measured 6:39/9:05 (avg 7:52) -> 36000 (~11:20; 9:35-13:05 across the two measured rates). Baseline 23280 (2:51/3:49/4:04) left unchanged. Unconfirmed by a fresh run.\"}}"
